    description: "Keycloak bakeoff: 20 ipc_recv chains falsely tag JPA query methods (JPAPermissionTicketStore.getPredicates, JPAPolicyStore.find, etc.) as reading from System.in. These files contain no System.in usage. Root cause: 'in' attribute from java.lang.System likely matching without module context. 'in' is not in Java ambiguous_names. Structural analogue of Deno.remove fix (add 'in' to Java ambiguous_names)."  # 2890
    fields: {}  # 2890
