  message: "Fixed in PR #40 (commit 0c2de3c). Added 'in', 'out', 'err' to Java ambiguous_names. JPA CriteriaBuilder.in() no longer falsely matches System.in. Module-qualified lookups (module_hint=System) still work correctly."  # 9efb
